/* DockFlip — Simplified Chinese (简体中文) */

"DockFlip Setup" = "DockFlip 设置助理";
"Back" = "返回";
"Welcome to DockFlip" = "欢迎使用 DockFlip";
"Your Dock works like the Windows taskbar, ⌘Tab switches windows, and windows snap into place — in one small app that works as soon as it starts." = "程序坞像 Windows 任务栏一样工作，⌘Tab 可切换窗口，窗口可贴靠到位——全部集成在一个启动即用的小巧 App 中。";
"Open System Settings" = "打开系统设置";
"DockFlip is already switched on in the list, but nothing changes?" = "DockFlip 已在列表中打开，但没有任何变化？";
"Reset Permission" = "重置权限";
"Launch at login" = "登录时启动";
"DockFlip is switched off in Login Items" = "DockFlip 已在登录项中关闭";
"Open Login Items and switch DockFlip on there to start it when you log in." = "打开登录项并在其中启用 DockFlip，即可在登录时启动。";
"Launch at login could not be changed" = "无法更改“登录时启动”";
"macOS did not accept the change." = "macOS 未接受此更改。";
"Open Login Items" = "打开登录项";
"Done" = "完成";
"Dock" = "程序坞";
"Rest on an icon to see its windows and tabs. Click to minimize and restore." = "将指针停留在图标上可查看其窗口和标签页。点按可最小化和恢复。";
"Switch between windows, not just apps." = "在窗口之间切换，而不仅是在 App 之间。";
"Snapping" = "贴靠";
"Drag to an edge or press ⌃⌥ and an arrow." = "拖到边缘，或按下 ⌃⌥ 和方向键。";
"Allow Accessibility" = "允许辅助功能";
"DockFlip needs one permission. It is used to list, focus, move and minimize windows, and for the ⌘Tab and ⌃⌥ shortcuts." = "DockFlip 需要一项权限，用于列出、聚焦、移动和最小化窗口，以及 ⌘Tab 和 ⌃⌥ 快捷键。";
"DockFlip has no networking code and no third-party code. Nothing it sees leaves your Mac." = "DockFlip 不含任何网络代码或第三方代码。它看到的任何内容都不会离开你的 Mac。";
"Show window thumbnails?" = "显示窗口缩略图？";
"Choose how windows look in the Dock list and in ⌘Tab. You can change this later in Settings." = "选择窗口在程序坞列表和 ⌘Tab 中的显示方式。你可以稍后在设置中更改。";
"Icon and title" = "图标和标题";
"No extra permission. Windows are told apart by title and a mini-map of where they are on screen." = "无需额外权限。窗口通过标题和显示其屏幕位置的小地图来区分。";
"Thumbnails" = "缩略图";
"Needs the Screen & System Audio Recording permission." = "需要“录屏与系统录音”权限。";
"Screen recording permission technically gives access to everything on screen. DockFlip captures only a small image of one window, only while you rest on a Dock icon or use ⌘Tab, keeps it in memory only and never while a password field is active." = "从技术上讲，录屏权限可以访问屏幕上的所有内容。DockFlip 仅在你将指针停留在程序坞图标上或使用 ⌘Tab 时捕获单个窗口的小图像，图像仅保存在内存中，且在密码栏处于活跃状态时绝不捕获。";
"Almost done" = "即将完成";
